{"4744160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Joust", "steam_appid": 4744160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4749890, 4974440], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Prepare... for... The Joust!</strong></i><br><br>(all screenshots below are captured with the real in-game camera and exported through our high-definition rendering pipeline)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras/42baf588967051b4b563c3d563e12e8a.avif?t=1788175661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras_big/42baf588967051b4b563c3d563e12e8a.webp?t=1788175661 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras/99b9a11c94f13f655762393eefcc39f7.avif?t=1788175661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras_big/99b9a11c94f13f655762393eefcc39f7.webp?t=1788175661 width=1560 height=878 /></span><i><strong>Hark ye!  Hark ye!  Gather ye 'round for the tournament is about to begin!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Joust is a highspeed, physics-rich simulation game with a specialty for freeform control.  Swing swords, sweep axes, and sling fireballs as you follow your path to become Champion of The Joust!  Competitive Online Multiplayer is available on numerous continents! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras/bf173f435187edbd01083d075661ed0a.avif?t=1788175661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras_big/bf173f435187edbd01083d075661ed0a.webp?t=1788175661 width=1560 height=878 /></span><i><strong>But ye, that is not all!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Joust delivers a variety of singleplayer experiences including:<br><br>    1. Online Competitive Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    2. a neverending, Roguelike gauntlet Heromaster mode,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    3. two Campaign Modes available on launch: Medieval and Space Age</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    4. Multiplayer Physics Soccer, Multiplayer Physics Ice Hockey, and Multiplayer Physics Field Hockey </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    4. Baseball, Basketball, Golf, Boxing, and Pole Vault simulations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    5. a cinematic studio mode capable of exporting 60 FPS video in 4K resolution</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    6. Stage Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    7. Campaign Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    8. Weapon Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    9. Roguelite Mode w/ metaprogression and unlocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    9. an infinite Adventure Mode with gathering and crafting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  and MANY MORE! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras/d1cb141ab7a16d304f553e16b981980a.avif?t=1788175661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras_big/d1cb141ab7a16d304f553e16b981980a.webp?t=1788175661 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Make it your own!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong> </strong></i><br> <br>The Joust can be customized in every which way!  Control gravity, movement speed, armor strength, projectile sizes... and just about everything else you can think of, for real!<br><br>Create a Class feature is also available for use in many game modes, including Online Multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras/50b5a6421ae26f26ffac2d126907a243.avif?t=1788175661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras_big/50b5a6421ae26f26ffac2d126907a243.webp?t=1788175661 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless possibilities for invention!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Joust will eventually ship lucrative modding tooling for generating ingame weapons, stages, and additional modded content.  In fact... nearly everything can be modded! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras/fbee318fc55fded8d5d00d07f9b1d7c7.avif?t=1788175661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras_big/fbee318fc55fded8d5d00d07f9b1d7c7.webp?t=1788175661 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made for community:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From day one, The Joust has been driven by community feedback.  For a while, this community meant a few people that listened to a pipedream idea of a game where cartoony simple geometry characters fight one another with swords... but it has grown into a wonderful array of hundreds of playtesters and a whole production team.<br><br> We have a Discord Community Server and a subreddit where players can go to help drive the development direction of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*******</strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Transparency / Development Tooling Notice:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>******</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Joust and its promotional material are the product of countless hours of human love and labor by a small, but passionate team of technology experts.  <i>Yes, even our lead composer</i> is a software professional by day.<br><br>With that in mind, in today's world it is important to tell the rest of the story!<strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br>The Joust appreciates transparency and forthcomingly discloses the use of modern LLM-driven tools to assist with code generation, code review, and performance optimization.  Aside from our handmade logos, The Joust does not ship traditional graphical assets and relies on mathematical generation of simple geometry to achieve its graphics.<br><br>The Joust is committed to<strong> NOT</strong> using any sort of AI-powered tools in our generation of marketing material.<br><br>All music for The Joust is composed, arranged, and performed by humans.<br><br>The Joust does<strong> NOT</strong> currently ship with localization features, but pledges to source its localization from real humans to the greatest extent practically verifiable by our team.<br><br>Most importantly, The Joust pledges to continue forward with its pro-human approach to art and design!<br><br> <br><br><br><strong>So long as it is allowed, The Joust is committed to retaining its $1 pricetag.</strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Most gratefully,</strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong>The Joust</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Prepare... for... The Joust!</strong></i><br><br>(all screenshots below are captured with the real in-game camera and exported through our high-definition rendering pipeline)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras/42baf588967051b4b563c3d563e12e8a.avif?t=1788175661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras_big/42baf588967051b4b563c3d563e12e8a.webp?t=1788175661 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras/99b9a11c94f13f655762393eefcc39f7.avif?t=1788175661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras_big/99b9a11c94f13f655762393eefcc39f7.webp?t=1788175661 width=1560 height=878 /></span><i><strong>Hark ye!  Hark ye!  Gather ye 'round for the tournament is about to begin!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Joust is a highspeed, physics-rich simulation game with a specialty for freeform control.  Swing swords, sweep axes, and sling fireballs as you follow your path to become Champion of The Joust!  Competitive Online Multiplayer is available on numerous continents! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras/bf173f435187edbd01083d075661ed0a.avif?t=1788175661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras_big/bf173f435187edbd01083d075661ed0a.webp?t=1788175661 width=1560 height=878 /></span><i><strong>But ye, that is not all!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Joust delivers a variety of singleplayer experiences including:<br><br>    1. Online Competitive Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    2. a neverending, Roguelike gauntlet Heromaster mode,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    3. two Campaign Modes available on launch: Medieval and Space Age</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    4. Multiplayer Physics Soccer, Multiplayer Physics Ice Hockey, and Multiplayer Physics Field Hockey </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    4. Baseball, Basketball, Golf, Boxing, and Pole Vault simulations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    5. a cinematic studio mode capable of exporting 60 FPS video in 4K resolution</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    6. Stage Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    7. Campaign Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    8. Weapon Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    9. Roguelite Mode w/ metaprogression and unlocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    9. an infinite Adventure Mode with gathering and crafting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  and MANY MORE! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras/d1cb141ab7a16d304f553e16b981980a.avif?t=1788175661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras_big/d1cb141ab7a16d304f553e16b981980a.webp?t=1788175661 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Make it your own!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong> </strong></i><br> <br>The Joust can be customized in every which way!  Control gravity, movement speed, armor strength, projectile sizes... and just about everything else you can think of, for real!<br><br>Create a Class feature is also available for use in many game modes, including Online Multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras/50b5a6421ae26f26ffac2d126907a243.avif?t=1788175661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras_big/50b5a6421ae26f26ffac2d126907a243.webp?t=1788175661 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless possibilities for invention!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Joust will eventually ship lucrative modding tooling for generating ingame weapons, stages, and additional modded content.  In fact... nearly everything can be modded! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras/fbee318fc55fded8d5d00d07f9b1d7c7.avif?t=1788175661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/extras_big/fbee318fc55fded8d5d00d07f9b1d7c7.webp?t=1788175661 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made for community:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From day one, The Joust has been driven by community feedback.  For a while, this community meant a few people that listened to a pipedream idea of a game where cartoony simple geometry characters fight one another with swords... but it has grown into a wonderful array of hundreds of playtesters and a whole production team.<br><br> We have a Discord Community Server and a subreddit where players can go to help drive the development direction of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*******</strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Transparency / Development Tooling Notice:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>******</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Joust and its promotional material are the product of countless hours of human love and labor by a small, but passionate team of technology experts.  <i>Yes, even our lead composer</i> is a software professional by day.<br><br>With that in mind, in today's world it is important to tell the rest of the story!<strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br>The Joust appreciates transparency and forthcomingly discloses the use of modern LLM-driven tools to assist with code generation, code review, and performance optimization.  Aside from our handmade logos, The Joust does not ship traditional graphical assets and relies on mathematical generation of simple geometry to achieve its graphics.<br><br>The Joust is committed to<strong> NOT</strong> using any sort of AI-powered tools in our generation of marketing material.<br><br>All music for The Joust is composed, arranged, and performed by humans.<br><br>The Joust does<strong> NOT</strong> currently ship with localization features, but pledges to source its localization from real humans to the greatest extent practically verifiable by our team.<br><br>Most importantly, The Joust pledges to continue forward with its pro-human approach to art and design!<br><br> <br><br><br><strong>So long as it is allowed, The Joust is committed to retaining its $1 pricetag.</strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Most gratefully,</strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong>The Joust</strong></p>", "short_description": "The Joust delivers laughably fun physics, HD cartoony graphics, and endless ways to brawl! Battle as a medieval knight, a futuristic space warrior, or even an elephant... with over 80 classes to choose from, the choice is yours! Multiplayer and Singleplayer are supported in a first-class fashion!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/a9e85a851d6348bd46e6985c1d08ccf7e0916656/header.jpg?t=1788175661", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/71b8794f5f80051b55cc78a6e008720523ab7035/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788175661", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744160/71b8794f5f80051b55cc78a6e008720523ab7035/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788175661", "website": "https://the-joust.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><stron